IMAPAccount tinywolfe
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
Host mail.tinywolfe.net
PassCmd "cat /home/bloodwolfe/.config/sops-nix/secrets/tinywolfe-mail-password"
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User bloodwolfe@tinywolfe.net

IMAPStore tinywolfe-remote
Account tinywolfe

MaildirStore tinywolfe-local
Inbox /persist/home/bloodwolfe/.mail/tinywolfe/inbox
Path /persist/home/bloodwolfe/.mail/tinywolfe/
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel tinywolfe
Create Both
Expunge Both
Far :tinywolfe-remote:
Near :tinywolfe-local:
Patterns *
Remove None
SyncState *

IMAPAccount google
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
Host imap.gmail.com
PassCmd "cat /home/bloodwolfe/.config/sops-nix/secrets/google-app_0"
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User bloodwolfepc@gmail.com

IMAPStore google-remote
Account google

MaildirStore google-local
Inbox /persist/home/bloodwolfe/.mail/bloodwolfe/inbox
Path /persist/home/bloodwolfe/.mail/bloodwolfe/
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel google
Create Near
Expunge Both
Far :google-remote:
Near :google-local:
Patterns * !drafts !sent
Remove None
SyncState *
